    Bug 1946978 - Port bug 1538451 - Add commands.openShortcutSettings(). r=mkmelin


    Firefox introduced a `commands.openShortcutSettings()` method in
    [D217920](https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D217920).

    This patch ports the new method to Thunderbird.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D238004

